---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import MainLayout from "../layouts/main.astro";
import Prose from "../components/prose.astro";
import photo from "../assets/leslie.png";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About"
  description="I'm Leslie, a senior frontend engineer. This is where I write things up, and where I link to the other things I've made."
>
  <Prose>
    <Image
      class="not-prose float-right mb-2 ml-4 size-28 sm:size-40"
      src={photo}
      width={320}
      height={320}
      loading="eager"
      alt="Leslie Hoare"
    />
    <p>
      I'm Leslie, a senior frontend engineer. This site is where I write things up
      when I've been tinkering with something. The posts so far are from 2019,
      2023 and 2026, so don't hold your breath for the next one.
    </p>

    <h2>Playground</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="https://lesleh.uk/">lesleh.uk</a> is my scratchpad for web experiments.
      It's mostly games, simulations and small AI things that run in the browser. A
      few to start with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <a href="https://lesleh.uk/playgrounds/connect-four">Connect 4</a>, against
        an AI that learned the game by playing itself
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://lesleh.uk/playgrounds/grokking">Grokking</a>, where a
        neural network memorises sums, gets nowhere for thousands of steps, then
        suddenly works it out
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://lesleh.uk/playgrounds/evolving-walkers"
          >Evolving Walkers</a
        >, where robots evolve their own brains until they can walk
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://lesleh.uk/playgrounds/lottery">Lottery Simulator</a>,
        which runs a million UK Lotto draws so you can watch the house win
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Recipes</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="https://recipes.lesleh.co.uk/">recipes.lesleh.co.uk</a> is where I
      keep the recipes I cook. It's mostly quick weeknight dinners, with the odd
      thing like{" "}
      <a href="https://recipes.lesleh.co.uk/recipes/rice-cooker-oyakodon"
        >rice cooker oyakodon</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>Code</h2>
    <p>
      My code is on <a href="https://github.com/lesleh">GitHub</a>, including{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/lesleh/lesleh.co.uk">the source for this site</a
      >.
    </p>
  </Prose>
</MainLayout>
